sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Клиент
    participant API as FastAPI Backend
    participant Bot as InterviewChatbot
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant LLM as LLM API

    Note over Client,LLM: ── Начало сессии ─────────────────────────────────
    Client->>API: POST /api/interview/start {topic, difficulty}
    API->>Bot: create_session(topic, difficulty)
    Bot->>Bot: _build_system_prompt(topic, difficulty)
    Bot->>DB: SELECT questions WHERE topic LIKE ? LIMIT 5
    DB-->>Bot: relevant_questions[]
    Bot->>DB: INSERT interview_chat_sessions (topic, difficulty, messages=[], status=active)
    DB-->>Bot: session_id
    Bot->>LLM: messages=[{role: system, ...}, {role: user, content: start}]
    Note over LLM: OpenRouter gpt-4o-mini (temp=0.7)<br/>→ Groq llama-3.1-70b<br/>→ Gemini fallback
    LLM-->>Bot: первый вопрос интервью
    Bot->>DB: UPDATE interview_chat_sessions SET messages=[...]
    API-->>Client: {session_id, question, topic, difficulty}

    Note over Client,LLM: ── Цикл вопрос-ответ ────────────────────────────
    loop Диалог (N вопросов)
        Client->>API: POST /api/interview/message {session_id, user_message}
        API->>Bot: process_message(session_id, user_message)
        Bot->>DB: SELECT interview_chat_sessions WHERE id=?
        DB-->>Bot: session {messages JSON, topic, difficulty}
        Bot->>Bot: Добавить user_message в messages
        Bot->>LLM: messages (вся история + ответ пользователя)
        LLM-->>Bot: {feedback, follow_up_question}
        Bot->>Bot: Добавить assistant response в messages
        Bot->>DB: UPDATE interview_chat_sessions SET messages=[...], updated_at=NOW()
        API-->>Client: {response, next_question}
    end

    Note over Client,LLM: ── Завершение сессии ─────────────────────────────
    Client->>API: POST /api/interview/end {session_id}
    API->>Bot: end_session(session_id)
    Bot->>DB: SELECT interview_chat_sessions WHERE id=?
    DB-->>Bot: full session history
    Bot->>LLM: Суммаризируй сессию (вопросы, ответы, оценка)
    LLM-->>Bot: summary text
    Bot->>DB: UPDATE SET status=completed, summary=...
    API-->>Client: {summary, total_messages, topic, difficulty}

    Note over Client,LLM: ── Fallback при недоступности LLM ──────────────
    opt LLM API недоступен
        Bot->>Bot: _fallback_question(topic, index)
        Bot-->>API: вопрос из hardcoded пула (Python/JS/Java/Go/React)
        API-->>Client: {question, is_fallback: true}
    end
